# no .scm needed: the composition of an input method (opt+` then a on a
# Mac) is shown in the editor as a pre-edit, then the committed text arrives
wait 7000
window #2
focus
click 300 400
wait 300
text ab
wait 300
compose `
wait 600
snapshot pe1
compose
text à
wait 600
snapshot pe2
# a plain letter, as the input methods of the CJK languages compose
compose n
wait 600
snapshot pe3
compose
text n
wait 600
snapshot pe4
